      "path": "/books/al-kafi:4:1:7:14",
      "text": [
        " سَمِعْتُ الرِّضَا ( عليه السلام ) يَقُولُ يَنْبَغِي لِلْمُؤْمِنِ أَنْ يَنْقُصَ مِنْ قُوتِ عِيَالِهِ فِي الشِّتَاءِ وَ يَزِيدَ فِي وَقُودِهِمْ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Yasser Al Khadim who said, ",
          "‘I heard Al-Reza<sup>asws</sup> saying: ‘It is befitting for the Believer that he reduces from the provision of his dependants during the winter and increases in their fuel (for heating expenses)’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "14. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from his father from Yasir al-Khadim who has said the following: “I heard abu al-Hassan al-Rida, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, say, ‘A man should spare from the means of his sustenance to provide fuel for his family during winter.’” "
        ]
      }
